'''Type of feat''': [[Class]]

'''Prerequisite''': [[Duelist]] level 6

'''Specifics''': The Duelist may make a leaping attack at an enemy. If the [[character]] is no closer than 5 ft, and passes a [[jump]] check, then Duelist gains a +2, +4, +6, or +8 bonus to attack and damage for that round.

'''Use''':  Selected

